Hi Sebastien,

Sorry for the delay in responding.  Yes, it looks like you've found a
problem! I've been able to reproduce it, and I see where it resides in
my code.  I will try and fix it this weekend if I have time.

For now, just set the time input to DODSGrab to one value.  That way,
you'll only get one model run.

Best,

Danny

